  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt mikrokreditprog</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">regional microcredits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Balkans Regional Microenterprise Programme covers BiH, Serbia and Montenegro, Macedonia, Albania and Kosovo. The aim is to expand the microcreditprogram in Serbia and to develop the capacity of the microcreditinstitutions in the other countries/areas. The programme is a three-year programme, but this financing covers just the first year.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett regionalt mikrokredit-program som inkluderar BiH, Serbien och Montenegra, Albanien, Makedonien och Kosovo. Finansieringen best&#xe5;r av nytt l&#xe5;nekapital till Serbien-programmet f&#xf6;r en ut&#xf6;kning av  verksamheten samt f&#xf6;r kompetensh&#xf6;jande &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder i de andra l&#xe4;nderna/omr&#xe5;dena. Programmet &#xe4;r ett tre&#xe5;rsprogram, men denna finansiering t&#xe4;cker endast f&#xf6;rsta &#xe5;ret.</narrative>
  </description>
